            "text": "Project documentation may reference NIST SP 800-88 for media sanitization, HIPAA safeguards when protected health information is involved, and California e-waste requirements. The applicable records depend on the equipment, service scope, and customer policy. Organizations should confirm their own retention and privacy requirements before scheduling disposition."
